   397	Grant compliance WP-5555 tied treasury wire cutoff failures attestation gaps to hold flag suppression visible only when hold flags used corrected rather than pre-correction ledger dates.
   398	
   399	Fixed-assets specialist T. Singh argued that treasury wire cutoff failures capitalization memos should not alter ledger status; investigators agreed while noting those memos still inform exception coding narratives.
   400	
