   672	## Investigation Brief 05 — Meeting Amendments and Owners
   673	
   674	Committee minutes show owner churn from unsigned drafts. Ledger owner is the
   675	default. Meeting note amendments under `#### Amendment for TXN-<uuid>` replace
   676	owner when `signed: true` (case insensitive) and, when the amendment includes
   677	`effective: YYYY-MM-DD`, only if that date is greater than or equal to the
   678	ledger date for the transaction.
