  1455	## Investigation Brief 09 — Mid-Year Amendment
  1456	
  1457	Mid-year QA found compliance holds disappearing after date corrections. This
  1458	amendment supersedes any earlier wording about hold timing. For `compliance_hold`
  1459	only, compare each qualifying email's `sent:` date against the transaction's
  1460	ledger date immediately before correction notices are applied — that is, the date
  1461	in effect after ledger load, meeting amendments, and compliance mail merges, but
  1462	before any correction notice changes `date` or `status`. Brief 03 still governs
  1463	mail-driven status changes; this amendment governs only the hold flag.
  1464	
