[?2004l   555	## Investigation Brief 04 — Correction Notice Precedence
   556	
   557	The corrections desk ships multiple notices per field. When several notices
   558	target the same transaction and field, the notice with the lexicographically
   559	greatest `effective` date wins. For each winning notice, `previous_value` in
   560	`reconciliation_report.jsonl` is the field value immediately before that notice
   561	applies (after ledger, amendments, and emails). Owner corrections override
   562	both ledger owners and signed meeting amendments when applied in this step.
   563	
