  1145	## Investigation Brief 08 — Exception Flags (Part II)
  1146	
  1147	Continued from Brief 07. Set `policy_waiver` when final status is `approved`,
  1148	`amount_usd` > 10000, and a Policy Exception block exists for that transaction
  1149	with `approved_by: compliance` on its own line. Set `retroactive_review` when
  1150	final status is `reversed`, `amount_usd` > 5000, and a winning correction
  1151	notice changed status for that transaction.
  1152	
