   973	## Investigation Brief 07 — Exception Flags (Part I)
   974	
   975	Exception coding review: `exception_reason` is null unless a code applies. Set
   976	`over_limit` when `amount_usd` strictly exceeds 10000. Set `compliance_hold`
   977	when final status is `rejected`, a qualifying `compliance@` email referenced
   978	that transaction, and that email block includes a `sent:` line. The sent-date
   979	comparison used for `compliance_hold` is defined in Investigation Brief 09
   980	(Mid-Year Amendment), not Brief 03. Multiple reasons join with semicolon in
   981	lexical order of the reason codes.
   982	
