   215	
   216	Interview notes with the compliance desk confirmed status fights between mail,
   217	amendments, and corrections. Ledger rows provide the base status (lowercase on
   218	output). Status precedence from lowest to highest is: pending, approved,
   219	rejected, reversed. Email excerpts may change status only when the From line
   220	contains `compliance@` anywhere in the address; ignore all other senders.
